      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.77,
      "end_seconds": 254.92,
      "duration_seconds": 13.15,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up. So, based on the the history and the examination, my working impression is an infection or something chronic going on, I can't say what yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.55,
      "end_seconds": 258.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Should I be worried about this?"
