      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.61,
      "end_seconds": 279.66,
      "duration_seconds": 16.05,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with an infection or something chronic going on, I can't say what yet do well once it's treated properly i'll request a chest X-ray, it'll help with weight loss and cough"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
