      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.56,
      "end_seconds": 294.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange a sputum test for chronic cough weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.99,
      "end_seconds": 316.64,
      "duration_seconds": 21.65,
      "text": "Right, right. I'd like you to see the chest clinic as well, and I'll write the referral. If you cough up blood or get breathless, or you feel really unwell, please come to the emergency department. Let's plan a check after the results are back. Call the clinic if you need us."
    },
